<title>USA: Redman says merger waiting period ends.</title>
<headline>Redman says merger waiting period ends.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Redman Industries Inc said Friday the anti-trust waiting period has expired for its proposed merger with Champion Enterprises Inc.</p>
<p>Under the deal, each Redman common share is to be converted into the right to acquire 1.24 Champion shares. The merger is valued at about $335 million.</p>
<p>The transaction is subject to approval at a special meeting of both companies' stockholders to be held on October 24.</p>
</text>
